    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιτέμνω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-τάμνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off on all sides, intercept and
				surround,</i> in tmesi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάμνοντ᾽ ἀμφὶ βοῶν ἀγέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.528
				</span></i>
			; <i>clear away,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνιν, χοῦν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.281
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.
			</span></i> Sinop.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.823.49
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Troezen</span>); <i>pare all round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνύχων ἀκίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.227
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.).</div>
